<tr nodeId="baa029c8e24a4a0da39f69eb8979dc6f">
<td colwidth="[157]" nodeId="136858f1a17149c3bd652f8fddcbd85d">
<p nodeId="9363bcde476c4dc8a81768912e212cc3">熔断配置列表</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[510]" nodeId="ae05dee9773c49b2a9bd4a2fa2f82419">
<p nodeId="d002ea34fb9d47acb4fdc62e450723c0">提交完成配置后，将会在熔断配置列表出现一条配置记录。</p>
<p nodeId="42d3299f2d2b416cb5148786f7c4f12b">熔断模式：单点熔断 （场景-规则）/  任务熔断（任务-规则-决策）</p>
<p nodeId="1a5181351cab4d8483a1809d97a220ff">单点熔断的一二三级范围代表：场景-规则-决策</p>
<p nodeId="c2c8e047e4504aa6bd66d59c782fb9d5">任务熔断的一二三级范围代表：任务-规则-决策</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="f62b2d71922d4cf085fc880a399d1248">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="1a1045fb17b341bc9845b1a2f30416cd">一个任务可以配置多个熔断，但是同期只有有一个配置是启用状态；记得在此处选择配置拨亮状态开关，开启熔断监控。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[571]" nodeId="b250cf1767324e618f050e2ab3b35be2">
<p nodeId="39083399cf994df99078de4fdf00fa71"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2157764712/90631656566?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1628.19" height="600" nodeId="a606756a6f3947229cd873729d9f21ec" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="318f9ec2572549d890d17f5ccf3254c3">
<td colwidth="[157]" nodeId="9d66cdf80e0142a4b70a32c6a15bbff8">
<p nodeId="1ca66b0a347e4384888c13921201b620">大象通知</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[510]" nodeId="4cd4dc0301794c24a6c4f7404255cba5">
<p nodeId="677cb422f81f4969a8fdd295a740a20e">如右图展示的是大象通知的内容</p>
<p nodeId="0ff21913dedb4d648826a06522d71c4a">同一个批次触发的熔断，会合并到一起进行通知</p>
<p nodeId="1bd82c3e00564166b4b27d18e2dd9409">点击【熔断名称】可打开zeus熔断配置预览页</p>
<p nodeId="a25a7bcaa8d64134b81acd11d2eda80d">点击【全部不处置】熔断符合预期，确认该数据不应该下发到下游</p>
<p nodeId="f153ed6f61d74b07a7e0b178b0b94f26">点击【全部恢复处置】熔断不符合预期，确认该数据应该下发到下游，点击后立即下发</p>
<p nodeId="3a56057c0f1f457c87e6557db9bec1a4">点击【熔断记录】跳转到熔断记录列表页，可查看本批次的全部熔断记录</p>
<p nodeId="16758d1d4b304a69956b982a3a5a1c70">点击【任务详情】跳转离线任务详情页</p>
<p nodeId="69a1bbce3f0c42e99fd96a7fcaf0e525">熔断场景举例：如果一个熔断任务下配置了10条规则，同一执行批次中，只有2个规则达到了熔断阈值，则只熔断2个规则的数据，剩余8个规则的数据仍继续向下流转</p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="5d16ded331924760b41365d03b214452">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="afcc75542c0e4bcea7e3a38bd7be3d76">如果只需要下发本批次部分数据，需前往熔断记录列表单独处理</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[571]" nodeId="d6fd507b85c743bc80e3c87d6b518bec">
<p nodeId="91a0a8ecc005444890af91d005a52927"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2157764712/90629919777?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="228" height="283" nodeId="3d53771648104d5c8cbc35360722eb09" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9a4137d06b7c4ef382544210ce44c891">
<td colwidth="[157]" nodeId="27b0afebf604479081221563030f9327">
<p nodeId="97cfd1eac06849309a637a7fa565b9db">熔断记录处理</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[510]" nodeId="735c04fe43e544458f449fb920236fa1">
<p nodeId="7e3078f051714d2e86f773f8ab997cfe">一个熔断ID代表一个执行批次，多条规则/决策触发，会产生多个重复的熔断ID</p>
<p nodeId="5cbbd1f130164fb88ff4e4da4570a554">单独处理某一部分数据时，请注意查看二级范围（规则）和三级范围（决策）</p>
<p nodeId="e799556aa94044249070426fdf64e00d">恢复处置：数据发送到下游</p>
<p nodeId="e797580dae3f4d8b8b51daa1e57fe4a4">不处理：数据不发送到下游</p>
<p nodeId="a08719c6a88d4da9a597065b77851d12">最近命中详情：跳转到dashboard，查询当前条件的详情数据，无需手动再次筛选</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[571]" nodeId="21781974525d41518880db424cea1e1a">
<p nodeId="991bf34aaca04e5c95d87b2693f116d1"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/2157764712/90637010636?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1074.34" height="600" nodeId="ec5c3a03f9f444afb6d5fee755917c07" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="5df32ff980f7439a9f20959d3175352e">四、FAQ</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="5f15dd1d6b4f410bbd4d821c0252689e">
<tr nodeId="dd19558027884bcea30768174964f015">
<th colwidth="[50]" nodeId="96299ade6ea14c2c814326f7d10083c7">
<p nodeId="faf23db4a46c4116ab864ad76f73bb03" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[599]" nodeId="5e2f6e9bff584ab09adf41a842f09855">
<p nodeId="8b8b0585af144985b896b22c09f5ac45">问题</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[602]" nodeId="250ec4b1e8e24ee5bd6450aa1c3bce44">
<p nodeId="3ccd1d594e0443e0a34bc3f75631b1c6">解答</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e834f15c475c469f8ddecc088a0a0f53">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="ddcfe7f1aff147c7a17a969a0eed2e99">
<p nodeId="a86753993b55493499cff63a601827fb" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[599]" nodeId="ed5fae3b508441afa1636e2b3f870f7a">
<p nodeId="bc7429adaa3b4060b037ae15c9fcb16c">当一条数据同时被多个规则命中，且规则中既包含正常规则也包含熔断规则，这种情况下如何处理？</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[602]" nodeId="972b02c8266b417785e4f0fe68339e3b">
<p nodeId="b9ab4482ccf4428fba7f248842ba1045">熔断规则优先，如果命中熔断规则则拦截该数据</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1349d3dc6ca64f1c89921282662810e9">
<td colwidth="[50]" numCell="true" nodeId="6cea3c00000544ed95b564cf025c22ed">
<p nodeId="d1a5431787024bb49ab8d1bb65b3838d" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[599]" nodeId="646cd19360c148f19a21d9a211eb7a96">
<p nodeId="14d8636ad8bc4084af3f4fdd63db91c1">当一条数据同时被多个熔断规则命中，恢复处置的时候需要逐个点击，点击第二条规则恢复处置的时候，会不会造成数据重复下发？</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[602]" nodeId="5fb8b73a51ec4b3bb98405d5f04cad2f">
<p nodeId="f7ad6939c94a4cba8db8e027ec8016d8">系统会进行当前批次数据比对，已经下发过的数据不会进行再次下发</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
