<km-footnote-item footnoteNodeId="151cba142cf54d5fb118ce885b40cd62" nodeId="1f79039b7f7c40feb0251a7545981551"><p nodeId="058ae515ddc74084bec5aef5da3029d9">不可全部为空或填“*”：一个填*，另一个为空是可以的</p></km-footnote-item>
