<km-footnote-item footnoteNodeId="6f81b8855ade4f7ab8c3a7656b616bfb" nodeId="2b6fadf664264bb5b5823b2266c338d5"><p nodeId="ce41d09824784d32af40f6e4e5fbfa5e">上个批次：不区分数据状态，即上一个批次的数据被熔断了，仍可参与比对计算</p></km-footnote-item>
